{"path":"utility/functional/binary_negate","title":"std::binary_negate","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>binary_negate","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/binary_negate","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"std::binary_negate is a wrapper function object returning the complement of the binary predicate it holds.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/functional\">&lt;functional&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Predicate <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> binary_negate<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"kw1\">public</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/binary_function\"><span class=\"kw1133\">std::<span class=\"me2\">binary_function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Predicate<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">first_argument_type</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Predicate<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">second_argument_type</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Predicate <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> binary_negate<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span